WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.950
[Soft original electronic score]

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:05.623
Before a word is spoken, clothing can begin a conversation.

00:00:06.473 --> 00:00:14.241
Tokyo's Harajuku district is known for street fashion, from colourful experimentation to distinctive subcultures.

00:00:15.091 --> 00:00:22.285
A sleeve, a silhouette, a colour: ordinary choices can become a language of self expression.

00:00:23.135 --> 00:00:31.003
This original abstract animation explores that idea. It does not document a designer or a runway collection.

